# 38. Role Dashboards: Executive & Governance

Roles: `superadmin`, `hospital_owner`, `hospital_admin`, `medical_superintendent` (+ `cmo`, `medical_director`), `hod`, `quality_officer`, `auditor`, `mis_reporting`, `it_admin`, `compliance_officer`, `dpo`.
Common standards: file 37. **Executive rule:** sirf aggregates; PHI masked; har number drill-down aur reconcile-able; no fake fallback values.

### Super Admin (platform owner) (`superadmin`)
- **Purpose:** Multi-tenant platform health, hospitals/clinics onboarding, revenue, compliance, incidents.
- **Current status:** spec `hmsDashboardSpec` · route `/superadmin/overview` · current depth: 4 KPIs / 3 tasks / 2 alerts / 4 queues / 4 actions / 2 modules
- **KPI cards (target):** Active tenants (hospitals/clinics/labs) + new this month; GMV / platform revenue / take-rate (MTD vs prev); Bookings today + success %; Open critical alerts / SLA breaches; Pending KYC / approvals count; System health (API p95, error %, queue lag, DLQ size)
- **Worklists / queues:** Pending onboarding & KYC (tenant, type, age, reviewer); Disputes & refunds escalations; Support tickets L2/L3 breaching SLA; Failed payments / webhook failures; Security events (break-glass, failed logins spike)
- **Alerts:** Payment gateway down / webhook backlog; Tenant data-export / deletion request overdue (DPDP clock); Rule-engine critical alert unacked; Backup/restore drill overdue
- **Quick actions:** Approve tenant, Impersonate (audited), Open feature flags, Broadcast announcement, Open audit log
- **Sections / tabs:** Overview · Tenants · Revenue · Trust & Safety · Compliance · Platform health · Costs · Settings
- **Features:** Tenant 360 (plan, usage, health, billing); Feature flags & rollout rings per tenant; Global announcements + maintenance windows; Cost & usage (SMS/WhatsApp/AI/storage); Fraud & abuse signals; Compliance register (licences, NABH, DPDP) with due dates
- **Data / APIs:** `/superadmin/*`, `/dashboard/overview`, `/rcm/*`, `/hub/*`, `/iam/*`, `/audit`, `/rules/alerts`; New: `/platform/health`, `/platform/tenants/:id/360`
- **Permissions & privacy:** Impersonation needs reason + step-up + audit; PHI hidden by default (break-glass to view); every action logged.
- **Mobile:** Read-only summary + critical alerts on mobile.

### Hospital Owner / Promoter (`hospital_owner`)
- **Purpose:** Business performance and strategic KPIs across branches; no clinical PHI.
- **Current status:** spec `hmsDashboardSpec` · route `/dashboards/hospital_owner` · current depth: 4 KPIs / 3 tasks / 2 alerts / 4 queues / 4 actions / 2 modules
- **KPI cards (target):** Revenue billed vs collected (MTD, YTD, vs budget); EBITDA proxy / ARPOB; Occupancy % & ALOS; OPD visits & growth; Doctor/department contribution; Receivables ageing (insurance/TPA/corporate); NPS / complaint trend; Cash position
- **Worklists / queues:** Top 10 receivable accounts; Dept P&L ranking; Budget variance by cost centre
- **Alerts:** Collections below target (rule); Occupancy < threshold 3 days; Claim rejection rate spike; NABH/licence expiry < 60d
- **Quick actions:** Download MIS pack, Approve capex (>limit), View branch comparison
- **Sections / tabs:** Executive summary · Revenue & cost · Operations · Quality & patient experience · Compliance · Approvals
- **Features:** Branch comparison, multi-hospital roll-up; Budget vs actual with drill-down; Doctor productivity & revenue share view; Scheduled MIS email (weekly) via Report Studio; Board pack export (PDF)
- **Data / APIs:** `/dashboard/overview`, `/rcm/pipeline`, `/finance/pnl`, `/reports/*`, KPI catalogue
- **Permissions & privacy:** Aggregates only; patient identifiers masked; export audit.

### Hospital Administrator (`hospital_admin`)
- **Purpose:** Daily 360° operations: beds, OPD/IPD/ER flow, revenue, staff, alerts, approvals.
- **Current status:** spec `hmsDashboardSpec` · route `/dashboard/v2` · current depth: 4 KPIs / 3 tasks / 2 alerts / 4 queues / 4 actions / 2 modules
- **KPI cards (target):** OPD visits (period, compare); IPD census + Bed occupancy %; Billed / Collected / Outstanding; ER active + door-to-doctor avg; Discharges pending + before-noon %; Staff on duty / absent; Critical lab unacked; Insurance claims pending / rejected
- **Worklists / queues:** Live OPD queue (doctor-wise wait); Pending approvals (discount, refund, PO, leave); Bed board heatmap by ward; OT schedule today; Discharge-ready patients with blockers; Low stock/expiry
- **Alerts:** Critical lab >15 min unacked; Bed cleaning >30 min; Pending discharge >4h; Bill overdue >30d; Equipment/licence due; Complaint SLA breach
- **Quick actions:** Approve discount/refund, Open bed board, Assign staff shift, Broadcast notice, Raise task
- **Sections / tabs:** Overview · Operations · Revenue · People · Quality · Approvals · Reports
- **Features:** Hospital Dashboard V2 widgets (ops strip, alerts center, revenue split, staff on duty, insurance pipeline); Date range + compare toggle; widget layout save/hide; Approvals inbox with escalation levels; Drill-down from every KPI; Daily MIS email; Day-end closing checklist
- **Data / APIs:** `/dashboard/{overview,operations,revenue,alerts,beds/heatmap,staff/on-duty,queue}`, `/approvals/*`, `/tpa/pipeline`, `/rules/alerts`
- **Permissions & privacy:** Clinical notes read-only + audited; no PHI export without reason.

### Medical Superintendent / CMO / Medical Director (`medical_superintendent`)
- **Purpose:** Clinical governance: mortality, infection, safety events, protocol compliance, doctor credentialing.
- **Current status:** spec `hmsDashboardSpec` · route `/dashboards/medical_superintendent` · current depth: 4 KPIs / 3 tasks / 2 alerts / 4 queues / 4 actions / 1 modules
- **KPI cards (target):** Mortality rate (crude/ICU/surgical); 30-day readmission %; HAI rate (CAUTI/CLABSI/SSI); Sentinel/near-miss events open; Critical-result ack within SLA %; Doctor credential expiries; Antibiotic stewardship compliance; Clinical audit scores
- **Worklists / queues:** M&M cases pending review; Incident reports (severity, RCA due); Death reviews due; Restricted antibiotic approvals; Doctor privileging requests; Consent/documentation deficiency
- **Alerts:** Sentinel event raised; HAI cluster (≥2 same ward 7d); Credential/registration expiry <30d; Medication error trend
- **Quick actions:** Open M&M board, Approve privileges, Review incident, Sign protocol
- **Sections / tabs:** Clinical quality · Safety events · Infection control · Credentialing · Mortality & morbidity · Protocols
- **Features:** M&M/Case-presentation board; NABH indicators auto-KPIs; Protocol & order-set approvals; Peer-review & audit scheduler; Clinical heat-map by dept
- **Data / APIs:** `/case-presentations`, `/infection-control/*`, `/safety/incidents`, `/quality/*`, `/credentials`, KPI catalogue
- **Permissions & privacy:** Can view identified clinical records only via care-relationship/break-glass; reason logged.

### Head of Department (`hod`)
- **Purpose:** Department performance, staffing, quality and teaching for one specialty.
- **Current status:** spec `hmsDashboardSpec` · route `/dashboards/hod` · current depth: 4 KPIs / 3 tasks / 1 alerts / 4 queues / 4 actions / 1 modules
- **KPI cards (target):** Department OPD/IPD volume; Avg consult time & wait; Dept revenue & doctor share; Procedure/OT utilisation; Dept readmission & complication %; Patient satisfaction (dept NPS); Duty roster fill %; Pending documentation
- **Worklists / queues:** Cases requiring HOD sign-off; Roster swap/leave requests; Consult/referral backlog; Unsigned discharge summaries (dept); Teaching/CME schedule
- **Alerts:** Roster gap in next 72h; Pending sign-offs >24h; Dept NPS drop; Critical case in ward
- **Quick actions:** Approve leave/swap, Assign consult, Sign summary, Open roster, Schedule M&M
- **Sections / tabs:** Overview · Doctors · Roster · Quality · Teaching
- **Features:** Doctor-wise productivity table; Roster planner (gaps heat-map); Protocol compliance board; Dept case presentation; Resident evaluation
- **Data / APIs:** `/roster/*`, `/doctor/*`, `/orders/*`, `/discharge/*`, `/insights/*`
- **Permissions & privacy:** Dept-scoped PHI only.

### Quality & Accreditation Officer (NABH) (`quality_officer`)
- **Purpose:** Audit, incidents, CAPA, indicators, document control.
- **Current status:** spec `hmsDashboardSpec` · route `/dashboards/quality_officer` · current depth: 4 KPIs / 3 tasks / 1 alerts / 4 queues / 4 actions / 1 modules
- **KPI cards (target):** NABH checklist completion % per chapter; Incidents open/closed, avg closure days; CAPA overdue; Hand-hygiene compliance %; Patient fall rate; Medication error rate; Internal audits due; Document reviews due
- **Worklists / queues:** Incident register (severity, RCA owner, due); CAPA tracker; Audit schedule & findings; SOP/policy versions awaiting ack; Indicator out-of-range list
- **Alerts:** Sentinel event within 24h; CAPA overdue; Audit overdue; Indicator breach
- **Quick actions:** Log incident, Start audit, Assign CAPA, Publish SOP
- **Sections / tabs:** Indicators · Incidents · CAPA · Audits · Documents · Accreditation
- **Features:** NABH chapter-wise evidence upload; Quality indicators auto-computed (KPI catalogue); Document control with read-and-acknowledge; Mock-assessment mode; Trend charts & control charts
- **Data / APIs:** `/quality/*` (NabhChapter, NabhAssessment, Capa), `/safety/incidents`, `/infection-control`
- **Permissions & privacy:** Incident narratives restricted; patient IDs masked unless needed.

### Internal / External Auditor (read-only) (`auditor`)
- **Purpose:** Independent verification of financial & clinical controls.
- **Current status:** spec `hmsDashboardSpec` · route `/dashboards/auditor` · current depth: 4 KPIs / 3 tasks / 1 alerts / 3 queues / 4 actions / 1 modules
- **KPI cards (target):** Exceptions found (period); Discounts/refunds above policy; Break-glass accesses; Bill edits/cancellations; Stock adjustments; Failed 4-eyes approvals
- **Worklists / queues:** Audit log search (who/what/when/where/before/after); Sampling worklist; Segregation-of-duties violations; Control test results
- **Alerts:** Control failure; Unreviewed break-glass >24h
- **Quick actions:** Run sample, Export evidence pack, Flag finding
- **Sections / tabs:** Audit trail · Controls · Financial exceptions · Access reviews · Evidence
- **Features:** Immutable audit trail viewer (hash-chain verified); Sampling & evidence pack export; SoD matrix checks; Tamper check (hash-chain) button
- **Data / APIs:** `/audit`, `/iam/access-log`, `/approvals/*`, `/finance/*` (read)
- **Permissions & privacy:** **Read-only**, no write routes, PHI masked unless audit-scope grant; every view logged.

